cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "heatpumps: A heat pump simulation model library and dashboard"
abstract: >-
  heatpumps is an open-source Python package providing a broad collection of
  ready-to-run heat pump cycle topologies built on TESPy and CoolProp. The
  models can be simulated in design and part-load operation and evaluated with
  respect to their efficiency, exergy destruction and investment cost, through
  both a documented model class API and an interactive web dashboard.
